	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quanquam non est, quod ad te nunc scribam, mi venerande charissimeque <lb xml:id="p1z2"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, scribendum tamen per adeo certum nuncium omnino putavi, ne <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>officio defuisse ulla ratione merito tibi videri possim, qui insignibus <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>etiam beneficiis salutare te debebam.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Singularem tuam munificentiam <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>toties iam prior expertus; verum non est hic mihi tecum certandi animus, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>qui sciam me turpiter, istuc si coner, vincendum.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Satis mihi fuerit, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>quando aliter fieri non potest, si memorem meum (a quo nihil expectas) animum tot <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>tantorumque tuorum in me collatorum beneficiorum intelligas tantisper, dum <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>domini benignitate adiutus reipsa aliquando, quam non fuerim ingratus, declarem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Verum sepe iam me ista tibi occinentem, mi suavissime anime, audisti <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>beneque tecum actum putabis, si non porro quoque sic tibi obstrepentem audire opporteat, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>id quod curabo tamen, ne moestius fiat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Novi nihil novi, quod ignores.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><placeName>Saxones</placeName> audimus magna intemperie <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>agi?</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">adversus nostrarum ecclesiarum ministros, in quos communia christianorum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>arma potius quam in <placeName>Turcos</placeName> verti opportere existiment idque non <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>pro concione solum, sed publicis etiam scriptis, quę alia super alia excudant, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>omnibus persuadere conentur.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Ego nihil, tu nihil non huius, scio, vidisti, si <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>vera sunt, quę constanter adeo minime vani viri affirmant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/><placeName ref="l491">Argentorati</placeName> certe librum mirifice prodigiosum iam divulgari accipio <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>huius ipsius odiosissimi iamdudum argumenti.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Autor quis sit, nondum audio; <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>sed in horas illinc literas affinis mei <persName ref="p8500">Petri Schaͤri</persName>, quem nosti, expecto, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>qui bona fide (non dubito), quicquid tragędiarum per istos quosdam praefractiores <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>quam doctiores et saniores homines motum est, copiose perscribet, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>tametsi omnia tu nunc certius ex summo et incomparabili theologo <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>d. <persName ref="p8111">P. Martyre</persName>, quem vestrum iam factum supra modum gratulor, vel cognoveris <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>vel propedie sis cogniturus.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Ah, quantum degenerant <placeName ref="l491">Argentinenses</placeName> non<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>nulli theologi a sanctissimi pię memorię <persName ref="p467">Buceri</persName> ingenio, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>qui cunctus ita perpetuo in concilianda stabiliandaque ecclesiarum <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Christi pace distringebatur, ut multis etiam immodicus hac in re videretur, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>cum in istis etiam decimam huius studii partem desyderare cogamur.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Faxit communis servator noster Iesus Christus, ut inter tot fatales <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>orbis christiani motus caput attollat, regnet ac triumphet veritas <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>nosque seriam resipiscentiam inter tot pressuras et turbines <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>mundi meditantes et apud creditas <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>nostrę fidei ecclesias fortiter urgentes nomen suum sive per vitam <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>sive per mortem in sanctitate et iusticia veritatis glorificemus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/>Bene vale, mi suavissime pectus, et assiduis piorum votorum tuorum <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>patrociniis apud Christum nos adiuva.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutem tibi, quam possunt, amanter <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>et veneranter ascribere iubent nostri, cumprimis <persName ref="p4868">Funclius</persName>, <persName ref="p1057">Fuch<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>sius</persName>, <persName ref="p7132">Witenbachus</persName> etc.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salveant symmiste et administri tui <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>in opere domini atque inter hos praecipue <persName ref="p8171">Theodorus</persName> noster, <persName ref="p8011">R. Gualtherus</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>gener tuus cum <persName ref="p3988">Wolfio</persName> et d. d. <persName ref="p8111">Martyr</persName> ille, si iam istuc advenit, <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>age fac mea vice per te officiosissime salutetur, candidus <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>vere ac integer christianę veritatis testis, cuius studium et opera <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ut scholę pariter et ecclesię vestrę frugifera et felicissima sint <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>a caelesti patre per Christum impetrare sedulo ac fideliter adnitor.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Iterum atque iterum vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l49">Bielis</placeName> 10. iulii 1556.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/>T[uus] <persName ref="p8055">Ambr[osius] <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>Bl<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>[<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>aurerus]</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/><persName ref="p8112">Frantzoß</persName> und keiser sollen widerum zertragen und de <lb xml:id="p3z2"/>funffjerig frid schon usß sin.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de">Der papst soll die keiserischen <lb xml:id="p3z3"/><persName>Coloneser</persName> vertriben haben und sich damitt declariert, wie <lb xml:id="p3z4"/>guͦt keiserisch er seye; aber da scheide nieman etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p3z5"/>Es soll der <persName>margraff Albrecht</persName> und <placeName ref="l572">Wirtemberg</placeName> sundern <lb xml:id="p3z6"/>verstand mitt einander gemacht und <persName>h[ertzog] Christoph</persName> ein <lb xml:id="p3z7"/>closter ingenomen haben usserhalb siner dition, da er <lb xml:id="p3z8"/>aber vermeint castvogt ze sin.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p3z9"/><placeName ref="l572">Wirtemberg</placeName>, <placeName ref="l1030">Wirtzburg</placeName>, könig <persName>Ferdinand</persName> und ettlich mehr <lb xml:id="p3z10"/>sollend sich von neuwem zuͦsamen verbunden haben.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p3z11"/>Die augspurgerisch confession wirt ymmer umgezogen, <lb xml:id="p3z12"/>wie man sich ob der vereinbart hab und daby blyben <lb xml:id="p3z13"/>welle; sy wurt aber uff ettlich weg in ettlichen articuln <lb xml:id="p3z14"/>gedüt und ussgelegt, das sy die eidgnosischen kirchen <lb xml:id="p3z15"/>all usschliessend; dawider will sich alles wetter erheben.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p3z16"/>Keiser soll in <placeName ref="l875">Hispaniam</placeName> sampt der <persName>kunigin Maria</persName> <lb xml:id="p3z17"/>und ein oder zweyen jungen herren k[önig] <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandi</persName> die schiff<lb xml:id="p3z18"/>fart fuͤrgenommen haben, sollen noch zuͦ <placeName ref="l1284">Brüchsel</placeName> sin...</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p3z19"/>Aber diß alles ist by uns noch ungewisß; warten all stund <lb xml:id="p3z20"/>brieff von <placeName ref="l18">Augspurg</placeName>, auch <placeName ref="l491">Strasburg</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p3z21"/>Was ir dero und anderer sachen halber gwiss haben, wellt <lb xml:id="p3z22"/>mir by disem gwissen botten nitt verhalten.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>D. <persName ref="p495">H. Bullingero</persName> suo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
